  "description": "And a friendly reminder....",
  "body_html": "<p>Trend is friend. You and I hear it all the time. But then we scroll the comments and finfluencers, screaming to “buy the dip” and to “dollar cost average.” Both of which, are fighting the trend. </p><p>If you are new to my page, <em><strong>this is a hill I will die on</strong></em>… do not dollar cost average down and do not buy dips. More than 90% of the influencers, and viewers, who chanted these things in 2008 and 2022, are no longer into investing. You will be corroborated and have confidence instilled a few times…maybe several times…but eventually, you will blow your portfolio. There is not a single market wizard that chants these popular online buzz phrases. </p><p><strong>Palantir is a “do not touch” stock right now.</strong> Maybe that will change in time…but not today! Watch the video, its why I make them, for more explanation. </p><p>I know its a bit scary buying green candles, or 52 week highs… you get used to it though, especially when you start seeing results over time. 9 out of my 13 <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">current positions</a> </strong></em>are in profit, 6 of those over 10% or 20%, and many of those winning stocks we have compounded the wins by <strong>dollar cost averaging up</strong>. </p><p>More optimistic news, even though today is a red down day (in which I never buy on red days), the overall trend remains upwards for the S&amp;P 500 specifically. There are still tons of stocks with great macro set ups…specifically nearly any stock in the finance sector that says “regional bank” I have ahigh confidence they have several more months of upward trend.</p><p>Not much to do or talk about today…if you missed <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-bull-market-continuesbut-for\">yesterday’s post</a>, at the bottom I noted I am targeting to add to a position at $29 or higher. It is currently at +18% profit and I am simply looking for a clean +20% before adding to the momentum. </p><p>As always, I am available in the <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d7312c75-2778-49bd-9b8e-ccab72528629\">main chat</a></strong> during market hours for any questions or commentary. We also have several other excellent traders in the group chat that are active. </p><p>Have a great Tuesday, and thanks for stopping by! </p><p>Oh…please do not forget to like ❤️ and re-stack (if you actually liked this post!)  </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/palantir-is-down-42buy-the-dip/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/palantir-is-down-42buy-the-dip/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/palantir-is-down-42buy-the-dip?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/palantir-is-down-42buy-the-dip?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p>",
